WEBVTT - Content modelling and data: agent skills for TYPO3 (en)

1
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:09.027
New content types, imported records and
translations, without breaking a single
relation.

2
00:00:10.127 --> 00:00:16.592
Content modelling and data: four skills for
TYPO3 v14.

3
00:00:17.892 --> 00:00:24.540
Defines content elements, records and page types
in one config.yaml each.

4
00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:30.370
The teaser shows up in the wizard. An editor
fills it in and saves.

5
00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:40.423
Creates, changes, translates and deletes records
from PHP through DataHandler.

6
00:00:41.773 --> 00:00:49.204
Raw INSERTs look fine until the reference index
is stale or imported records belong to nobody.

7
00:00:50.604 --> 00:00:57.356
Fixes labels and XLIFF files, including plural
forms with ICU MessageFormat.

8
00:00:58.706 --> 00:01:06.947
A raw label key on screen or duplicate ids after
a merge are small bugs that editors see first.

9
00:01:08.347 --> 00:01:15.648
Generates thematic tags for EXT:news and assigns
them to existing articles by keyword.

10
00:01:16.998 --> 00:01:26.676
It is made for archives too large to tag by
hand, on TYPO3 v14.3 with georgringer/news 14.

11
00:01:28.276 --> 00:01:32.520
Open source. Clone the skills, and help us
improve them.
